{"id":"esposo","lemma":"esposo","pos":"noun","rank":646,"glosses":["husband"],"ipa":"/esˈposo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"esposos","feminine":"esposa","femininePlural":"esposas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-esposo.wav","formAudio":{"esposa":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/30/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-esposa.wav","esposas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-esposas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"A mi esposo le gusta dormir.","en":"My husband likes to sleep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522585","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to sleep"}]},{"text":"Ya no quiero ser tu esposo.","en":"I no longer wish to be your husband.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687665","words":[null,null,{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"your"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"no longer"]]},{"text":"Mi esposo me va a matar.","en":"My husband's going to kill me.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"okay"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"at each other's throats"]]},{"text":"¿Está tu esposo en casa?","en":"Is your husband at home?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"your"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"home"]]},{"text":"Mi esposo está en el trabajo.","en":"My husband is at work.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,6,"at work, on the job"]]}]}